          "value": "xywh=pixel:215.50624084472656,2550.060302734375,2667.8875579833984,2122.320068359375",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>That of which I inform the mu\u02bfallim the tax farmer of Mis\u0323r al-Qadi\u0304ma: please return the receipt [?] that you took</li>\n<li>from \u02bfAt\u0323i\u0304ya because he is from our division and from among our clients. Indeed, the ami\u0304r \u02bfAli\u0304 sent to us a flock [?]</li>\n<li>of sheep numbering 20 head of sheep. Be very, very careful to deliver the receipt</li>\n<li>to our man al-H\u0323a\u0304jj Munajja\u0304 [?] with all haste. Make sure there is no neglect in this,</li>\n<li>and no excuse and no trick of any kind, and no delay. As to the correct seal [meaning Meh\u0323med C\u0327avus\u0327&rsquo;s seal],</li>\n<li>here [i.e., on the verso] is the proof. God knows best.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
